<title>UK: British inflation rate falls to 2.1 pct in August.</title>
<headline>British inflation rate falls to 2.1 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retail prices rose 0.5 percent in August for an annual increase of 2.1 percent, down from 2.2 percent in July, official figures showed on Thursday. Retail prices fell 0.4 percent in July. The figures were at the top end of analysts's expectations.</p>
</text>
